{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "techzone-api-collection",
		"name": "TechZone E-commerce API",
		"description": "Complete API collection for TechZone e-commerce platform. Includes authentication, product management, shopping cart, and order processing.\n\n**Base URL**: http://localhost:8080/api\n\n**Authentication**: JWT Bearer Token\n\n**Test Accounts (Postman, distincts des tests Java)**:\n- User: créer avec « Register New User » puis utiliser « Login » (postman.newuser@techzone-test.com / PostmanNew123!)\n- Admin: postman.admin@techzone-test.com / PostmanAdmin123! (créé par setup-test-users.sh + promotion H2)\n\n**Setup**: \n1. Register or login to get JWT token\n2. Token is automatically saved to environment variable\n3. All authenticated requests use {{jwt_token}} variable",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"event": [
		{
			"listen": "test",
			"script": {
				"exec": [
					"pm.test('Réponse reçue (statut 2xx)', function() {",
					"    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200, 299);",
					"});",
					"",
					"pm.test('Temps de réponse acceptable (< 10s)', function() {",
					"    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(10000);",
					"});"
				],
				"type": "text/javascript"
			}
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Register New User",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set('jwt_token', jsonData.accessToken);",
									"    pm.environment.set('user_id', jsonData.id);",
									"    console.log('Token saved:', jsonData.accessToken);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"postman.newuser@techzone-test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"PostmanNew123!\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Postman New User\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/register",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["auth", "register"]
						},
						"description": "Register a new user account. Returns JWT token upon successful registration."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set('jwt_token', jsonData.accessToken);",
									"    pm.environment.set('user_id', jsonData.id);",
									"    console.log('Token saved:', jsonData.accessToken);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"postman.newuser@techzone-test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"PostmanNew123!\"\n}"
						},
